# ── Provisioning ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
@Given "^a reason exists$"
    Given build json request with body from test data 'reason-create'
    When post to path '/refdata/reasons'
    Then response status code is '200'
    And store response field 'data.id' as 'reasonId'

# ── Build request ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
@Given "^admin has valid data for a new trade lifecycle event reason$"
    Given build json request with body from current scenario

# ── Make api call ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
@When "^creates the new reason$"
    When post to path '/refdata/reasons'
    And attach the response body to the report

@When "^retrieves all available trade lifecycle event reasons$"
    Given build request as user 'maker@example.com'
    When get from path '/refdata/reasons'
    And attach the response body to the report

# ── Then steps - Assertions──────────────────────────────────────────
@Then "^the reason should be created and persisted successfully$"
    Then the 'reason' should be 'created' successfully

@Then "^all configured reasons are returned with a total count of '([^']*)'$"
    Then the 'reason' should be 'retrieved' successfully
    And response body contains a key 'data.totalElements' with value '$1'
